@ 46.8 - Greek Vowel Shift
# citation: Chris Zoller, from Trask, R.L. (1996), Historical Linguistics
	{ u, u:[+long] } > { y, y:[+long] }
	o:[+long] > u:[+long]
	e:[+long] ɛ:[+long] > i:[+long] e:[+long]
	ai ɔi > ɛ y:[+long]
	e:[+long] > i:[+long]
	{ y, y:[+long] } ɔ:[+long] > { i, i:[+long] } ɔ
	ɛu au > ɛv av